.TH batten-hk-observe 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-hk\-observe \- Record what this session resolved of the runner, once per contract digest
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten hk observe\fR [\fB\-\-session\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Record what this session resolved of the runner, once per contract digest
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-session\fR
The host\*(Aqs session identifier; without one no receipt is written
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
